    <innernamespace refid="namespacehorus__bt">horus_bt</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs HORUS behavior trees in-process, on their own thread, for the supervisor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Loads every BT XML of the given folders, registers the HORUS leaves, and ticks one tree at a time. start() and stop() never block: the tick thread picks the request up within microseconds, halts the running tree and builds the next one, so a mode change never waits for a tick. The result of a tree is reported once through its callback, with the id given to start(); a tree that is replaced or stopped reports nothing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
